scription_i18n/cn","用红酒和魔法炙烤敌人，持续对范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","ワインと魔法で敵を炙り、範囲内の敵に持続的にダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法蒂玛向敌方最密集区域泼洒半径1格范围的红酒，并用魔法炙烤敌人持续5秒，期间每0.5秒对其中敌人造成45% + 6% ATK伤害。本技能“狂热”后会在炙烤结束时额外点燃红酒爆发火焰，对范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","敵が最も密集しているエリアにワインを撒き、魔法で半径1マス範囲内の敵を5秒間炙り、0.5秒ごとに45% + 6% ATKのダメージを与える。このスキルに「狂喰」が付与されている場合、追加でワインに火をつけ、爆炎で範囲内の敵に240% + 30% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":53,"end":58,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":51,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":48,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":112,"end":126,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至50% + 6% ATK，额外伤害提高至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが50% + 6% ATKにUPし、追加ダメージが260% + 30% ATKにUP"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":29,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":33,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":25,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":29,"end"